 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Urenokori Maid, Kattekudasai!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "売れ残りメイド、買ってください！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Welcome, dear guest. Here at this mansion, our excellent 'maids' are on a massive sale today as always.\nWe come in all kinds—humans, elves, beastfolk, dragonkin, and more.\nFrom serving meals to helping with adventures, even handling 'jobs behind the scenes,' we super all-purpose, excellent ultra-maids can do it all.\nPlease, won’t you consider purchasing us? ...No good? Oh come on, somehow, please!\nIsn’t there anyone out there willing to buy us?!",
   "ja": "ようこそ、お客様。この館では、私たち優秀な「メイド」が今日も大セール中です。\n種族は人間、エルフ、獣人に竜人など多種多様。給仕はもちろん、冒険のお手伝いや \"\"裏の仕事\"\"まで、なんでもこなす私たちスーパー万能エクセレント超メイドを、ぜひお買い求めくださいませ。……ダメ？いやそこをなんとか！お願いします！誰かー！\n私たちを買ってくれる方はいませんかー!?"
  },
